# Normalize text to LF in the repository and in every checkout (Git for Windows defaults to autocrlf=true; a CRLF shebang in
# bin/*.mjs fails on macOS and Linux, and golden-file tests compare exact bytes).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
